// 1960 Plymouth 383 (Chrysler) 280 @ 4200
// Created by oror 2026

// Plymouth
// Savoy — 1960–1964
// Belvedere — 1960–1970
// Fury — 1960–1969
// Sport Fury — 1960–1969
// Satellite — 1965–1970
// Barracuda — 1967–1969
// Road Runner — 1968–1970
// Suburban — 1960–1961
// Custom Suburban — 1960–1961
// Sport Suburban — 1960–1961

